The documentation for [genre](https://schema.org/genre) says that the values expected is of type text or URL. However, the [JSON-LD Context file](https://schema.org/docs/jsonldcontext.json) says:

```
genre: {
    @id: "schema:genre",
    @type: "@id"
},
```

which forces the value to be _always_ a URL. This may also lead to syntactically incorrect URL-s, and is certainly not in line with the documentation...

