We are currently thinking how to best add "metametadata" – i.e. information about the structuted data itself (like provider, date created/modified or indication of a metadata profile the structured data conforms to) – using schema.org properties. Provisionally, we have been using [`sdo:mainEntityOfPage`](https://schema.org/mainEntityOfPage) resulting in something like this:

```json
{
  "id": "https://example.org/oer",
  "mainEntityOfPage":[
    {
      "id":"https://example.org/oer.json",
      "type":"Text",
      "provider":{
        "id":"https://example.org/provider",
        "name":"Example Metadata Provider"
      },
      "dateCreated":"2020-01-01",
      "dateModified":"2020-02-02",
      "conformsTo":"https://w3id.org/kim/lrmi-profile/2021mmdd/"
    }
  ]
}
```

(Note, we'd match the `conformsTo` to http://purl.org/dc/terms/conformsTo.)

For different reasons, we do not want to use `mainEntityOfPage` anymore and are thinking about alternatives. (See https://github.com/dini-ag-kim/lrmi-profile/issues/63#issuecomment-848731390 (in German) for context.) 

With #1886 the properties [`sdo:sdPublisher`](https://schema.org/sdPublisher), [`sdo:sdLicense`](https://schema.org/sdLicense) and [`sd:sdDatePublished`](https://schema.org/sdDatePublished) were added to pending to enable statements about the structured data itself instead about the described resource. However, I this does not completely solve our problem as we need to add more information than these three statements about the structureed data itself and I also think that this is not the best approach to address the problem.

That is why I propose to add a property `sdo:structuredData` or similar to schema.org so that one can add metametadata while being able to utilize all the properties from `sdo:CreativeWork` and properties from other vocabularies (like `dct:conformsTo`). Its usage would look something like this:

```json
{
  "@context":{
    "@vocab":"https://schema.org",
    "conformsTo":"http://purl.org/dc/terms/conformsTo"
  },
  "id":"https://example.org/oer",
  "structuredData":[
    {
      "type":"Text",
      "provider":{
        "id":"https://example.org/provider",
        "name":"Example Metadata Provider"
      },
      "dateCreated":"2020-01-01",
      "dateModified":"2020-02-02",
      "conformsTo":"https://w3id.org/kim/lrmi-profile/2021mmdd/"
    }
  ]
}
```

